//   6. 12-Paradigm Hybrid Training Combinator Studio (Dynamic Multi-Stage Training Combinations)
//   7. PBRuler Adaptive Biological Immune System (Innate Hard Rules + B/T-Cell Antigen Quarantine & O(1) Antibody Memory)
